# supercronic reads this inside the container. Seven jobs share this one
# clock now: the sweeper's own drain, the five evaluated-stream/status
# pollers #774 moved off GitHub Actions `schedule:` — which delivered them
# roughly once every four hours (#773's measurements) — and, since #792,
# the uptime probe, moved for the same reason (115 minutes measured against
# its hourly cadence on 2026-09-08). All onto the always-on clock
# `hummingbird-sweeper` already runs. Adding an entry here extends the
# clock supercronic already owns; it does not start a second one
# (CLAUDE.md's "No competing clocks" rule; #773 makes the argument in
# full).
#
# Each poller's cadence matches its own `POLLED_EVERY_MS` (or, for
# `github-status-poll` and `uptime-probe`, `body::POLLED_EVERY_MS`): the
# four stream pollers every 15 minutes, `github-status-poll` every 30,
# `uptime-probe` hourly (ADR-0017 decision 6 — each probe cold-boots the
# scale-to-zero runner, so hourly is deliberate and not faster). The minute
# offsets are staggered off `/app/sweep` and off one another, deliberately
# — the machine is `shared-cpu-1x`/256mb, and seven jobs landing on the
# same tick is an avoidable spike rather than a necessary one. The probe's
# `:37` is additionally kept clear of every sweep tick because that job
# wakes another Fly machine.
#
# No timeout wrapper around `uptime-probe`: the bin bounds every request
# itself (`HTTP_TIMEOUT = 30s` in its `main.rs`), which is what actually
# bounded a hung fetch — the runner's deliberate cold boot included — when
# it ran under Actions' `timeout-minutes: 15` too. Nothing to add here.
*/15 * * * * /app/sweep
2,17,32,47 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$GMAIL_INGEST_TOKEN" /app/bin/hummingbird-gmail-poll
5,20,35,50 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$CALENDAR_INGEST_TOKEN" /app/bin/hummingbird-calendar-poll
8,23,38,53 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$M365_MAIL_INGEST_TOKEN" /app/bin/graph-mail-poll
11,26,41,56 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$M365_CALENDAR_INGEST_TOKEN" /app/bin/graph-calendar-poll
14,44 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$GH_STATUS_INGEST_TOKEN" GITHUB_TOKEN="$GH_STATUS_PAT" /app/bin/github-status-poll
37 * * * * HB_INGEST_TOKEN="$UPTIME_PROBE_INGEST_TOKEN" /app/bin/uptime-probe
